      "review_summary": "The PR adds no-op stdout/stderr stream error listeners to the Codex sandbox process RPC and streaming HTTP helper child processes.\n\nPR surface: Source +9. Total +9 across 2 files.\n\nReproducibility: no. high-confidence runtime reproduction was established. Source inspection on current main shows both affected spawn paths lack stdout/stderr stream error listeners, which is the reported crash class.",
